{"step_index":157,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T14:55:21Z","thinking":"Analyzing the scratch defect, the thin linear nature suggests morphological transformations are suitable. Considering both dark scratches on bright surfaces and vice-versa, BlackHat and TopHat transforms appear necessary for comprehensive detection.\n\n\nIsolating scratches involves applying morphological transformations (BlackHat and TopHat) to the grayscale image, effectively removing surface texture and highlighting the linear scratch features.  Bounding box creation will focus on prominent scratch components, merging aligned segments, ensuring the box encompasses the defect while avoiding unnecessary inclusion of the entire image.\n\nRust detection utilizes color deviation from the metal background, employing color space transformations (LAB + HSV) to identify localized patches.  The approach prioritizes finding the primary rust cluster for bounding box creation, constraining maximum box dimensions to prevent full-frame coverage. If high-contrast features are absent, a compact box centered on the maximum anomaly intensity serves as a fallback.\nInspection of multiple or single images will be presented through an interactive and responsive grid layout with a toggle for thumbnail/full-view display.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"\\\"\\\"\\\"YOLOv8 inference wrapper with visual defect localization and uncertainty handling.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport os\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom typing import Optional\\n\\nimport cv2\\nimport numpy as np\\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\\n\\nfrom utils.constants import (\\n    DEFECT_CLASSES,\\n    DEFECT_COLORS,\\n    STATUS_COLORS,\\n    CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD,\\n    NOVEL_THRESHOLD,\\n    MODEL_PATHS,\\n)\\n\\ntry:\\n    from ultralytics import YOLO\\n    _YOLO_AVAILABLE = True\\nexcept ImportError:\\n    _YOLO_AVAILABLE = False\\n\\n_model_cache: dict[str, object] = {}\\n\\n\\n# ── Model Loading ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n\\ndef load_model(custom_path: Optional[str] = None) -> tuple[object | None, str | None]:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Return (model, error_msg). Model is cached per path.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    if not _YOLO_AVAILABLE:\\n        return None, (\\n            \\\"ultralytics not installed.\\\\n\\\"\\n            \\\"Run: pip install ultralytics\\\"\\n        )\\n\\n    search_paths = ([custom_path] if custom_path else []) + MODEL_PATHS\\n    for path in search_paths:\\n        if not path:\\n            continue\\n        if path in _model_cache:\\n            return _model_cache[path], None\\n        if os.path.exists(path):\\n            try:\\n                model = YOLO(path)\\n                _model_cache[path] = model\\n                return model, None\\n            except Exception as exc:\\n                return None, f\\\"Failed to load {path}: {exc}\\\"\\n\\n    checked = [p for p in search_paths if p]\\n    return None, (\\n        f\\\"Model weights not found.\\\\n\\\"\\n        f\\\"Checked:\\\\n\\\" + \\\"\\\\n\\\".join(f\\\"  • {p}\\\" for p in checked) +\\n        \\\"\\\\n\\\\nPlace best.pt at D:\\\\\\\\acceleration\\\\\\\\best.pt or upload below.\\\"\\n    )\\n\\n\\n# ── Precise Computer Vision Defect Localizer ────────────────────────────\n<truncated 14532 bytes>","Description":"\"Refined defect detector with precise rust, scratch, crack, and hole contour filters and compact bounding boxes without full-image zoom artifacts\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\win-10\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\neurax_app\\\\modules\\\\defect_detector.py\"","toolAction":"\"Updating defect detector\"","toolSummary":"\"Update defect localization and annotation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
