{"step_index":205,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T15:16:35Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python -c \\\"\\nimport torch\\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\\nimport numpy as np\\nimport cv2\\nfrom PIL import Image\\nfrom ultralytics import YOLO\\n\\nmodel = YOLO(r'D:\\\\acceleration\\\\best.pt')\\npytorch_model = model.model.eval()\\n\\n# GradCAM hook\\nfeatures = []\\ngrads = []\\n\\ndef forward_hook(module, input, output):\\n    features.append(output)\\n\\ndef backward_hook(module, grad_in, grad_out):\\n    grads.append(grad_out[0])\\n\\ntarget_layer = pytorch_model.model[8]\\ntarget_layer.register_forward_hook(forward_hook)\\ntarget_layer.register_full_backward_hook(backward_hook)\\n\\n# Test forward pass with gradient\\nimg = np.random.randint(0, 255, (224, 224, 3), dtype=np.uint8)\\ntensor = torch.from_numpy(img).permute(2, 0, 1).unsqueeze(0).float() / 255.0\\ntensor.requires_grad = True\\n\\noutput = pytorch_model(tensor)\\nif isinstance(output, tuple):\\n    output = output[0]\\n\\n# Backward for top class\\ntop_class = output.argmax(dim=1).item()\\noutput[0, top_class].backward()\\n\\n# Compute GradCAM\\nfeature = features[-1][0].detach()  # [C, H, W]\\ngrad = grads[-1][0].detach()        # [C, H, W]\\nweights = grad.mean(dim=(1, 2), keepdim=True)\\ncam = (weights * feature).sum(dim=0)\\ncam = F.relu(cam).cpu().numpy()\\ncam = (cam - cam.min()) / (cam.max() - cam.min() + 1e-8)\\ncam_resized = cv2.resize(cam, (224, 224))\\nprint('GradCAM computed successfully! Shape:', cam_resized.shape, 'Max:', cam_resized.max())\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\win-10\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\neurax_app\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Testing GradCAM implementation\"","toolSummary":"\"Verify GradCAM on YOLOv8\""}}]}
{"step_index":206,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-19T15:16:35Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-19T20:46:35+05:30\nTool is running as a background task with task id: f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/task-206\nTask Description: python -c \"\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport numpy as np\nimport cv2\nfrom PIL import Image\nfrom ultralytics import YOLO\n\nmodel = YOLO(r'D:\\acceleration\\best.pt')\npytorch_model = model.model.eval()\n\n# GradCAM hook\nfeatures = []\ngrads = []\n\ndef forward_hook(module, input, output):\n    features.append(output)\n\ndef backward_hook(module, grad_in, grad_out):\n    grads.append(grad_out[0])\n\ntarget_layer = pytorch_model.model[8]\ntarget_layer.register_forward_hook(forward_hook)\ntarget_layer.register_full_backward_hook(backward_hook)\n\n# Test forward pass with gradient\nimg = np.random.randint(0, 255, (224, 224, 3), dtype=np.uint8)\ntensor = torch.from_numpy(img).permute(2, 0, 1).unsqueeze(0).float() / 255.0\ntensor.requires_grad = True\n\noutput = pytorch_model(tensor)\nif isinstance(output, tuple):\n    output = output[0]\n\n# Backward for top class\ntop_class = output.argmax(dim=1).item()\noutput[0, top_class].backward()\n\n# Compute GradCAM\nfeature = features[-1][0].detach()  # [C, H, W]\ngrad = grads[-1][0].detach()        # [C, H, W]\nweights = grad.mean(dim=(1, 2), keepdim=True)\ncam = (weights * feature).sum(dim=0)\ncam = F.relu(cam).cpu().numpy()\ncam = (cam - cam.min()) / (cam.max() - cam.min() + 1e-8)\ncam_resized = cv2.resize(cam, (224, 224))\nprint('GradCAM computed successfully! Shape:', cam_resized.shape, 'Max:', cam_resized.max())\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/.system_generated/tasks/task-206.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
